# Copied by Vercel into the build as VITE_API_BASE_URL.
# Optional. Only set this for a fully cross-origin setup (frontend and
# backend on completely separate domains served to the browser).
#
# Examples:
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.thermalwatch.example.com/api/v1
#
# Leave unset in the common case: the app calls same-origin /api/v1 and
# Vercel's /api rewrite (vercel.json + VERCEL_API_BASE_URL) forwards it to
# the FastAPI backend. Vercel ignores files named .env*, so this file is
# documentation only — set the variables in the Vercel dashboard.
